{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVE INTO WONDERLAND</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Story of the Lost Dot is a unique, simple, and fun casual game where you play as a small dot fallen from your place after 'THE END' in Alice's Adventures in Wonderland. Literally dive into the novel's text and begin a story of your own within Carroll's timeless classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls are simple: you can roll left or right and rewind time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will go deeper and deeper inside the novel, trying to find your way, avoiding traps and enemies. You need to find your way back to the end where you belong to make the story complete again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's black and white aesthetic features real art from John Tenniel, who originally illustrated the book, creating a timeless bridge between Carroll's Victorian era and our digital age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mystery as the last dot of the 1865 novel Alice's Adventures in Wonderland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies and avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN OTHERS AND FOLLOW THE WHITE RABBIT DOWN THE RABBIT-HOLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. You can communicate with other players in the game's guestbook and compete with others by collecting points. Points are based on the actual letter frequency in Carroll's original text \u2013 rare letters reward you with higher scores, while common ones offer steady progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;THE END&quot; was the last word in </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alice's Adventures in Wonderland</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>that Lewis Carroll wrote.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And you were the last dot.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>That dot after &quot;THE END&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The last dot that every story has.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Then something strange happened.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Now you need to find your way back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And make the story complete again.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY WITHIN THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a father of two little daughters, I spend countless evenings reading children's books aloud. One night, while reading Lewis Carroll's Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, something magical happened. In my mind's eye, I saw a single dot falling through the letters on the page \u2013 a tiny punctuation mark tumbling through the words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That moment of inspiration became the seed for The Story of the Lost Dot. I knew right away that I needed to make a game of this vision I had. Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, written in 1865, belongs to the public domain, which allowed me to build my game around this classic tale.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2764580?t=1759474431","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2764580?t=1759474431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/a17a880a997fb89c4794b66502c6722eb2283217/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759474431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/a17a880a997fb89c4794b66502c6722eb2283217/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759474431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVE INTO WONDERLAND</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/40c74b0f27f66c3940878f9bd0aac756.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Story of the Lost Dot is a unique, simple, and fun casual game where you play as a small dot fallen from your place after 'THE END' in Alice's Adventures in Wonderland. Literally dive into the novel's text and begin a story of your own within Carroll's timeless classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls are simple: you can roll left or right and rewind time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/3f69c610798084a9b5df70c55356ad03.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will go deeper and deeper inside the novel, trying to find your way, avoiding traps and enemies. You need to find your way back to the end where you belong to make the story complete again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/68a1928817c4471e607f9cefafbbd7fa.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's black and white aesthetic features real art from John Tenniel, who originally illustrated the book, creating a timeless bridge between Carroll's Victorian era and our digital age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/a680281cf2c74d5ac69db017a5fc95f0.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mystery as the last dot of the 1865 novel Alice's Adventures in Wonderland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies and avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.poster.avif?t=1759474431\" width=1024 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.webm?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/extras/1472908eb4c747deb82eeb8f6159e32f.mp4?t=1759474431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN OTHERS AND FOLLOW THE WHITE RABBIT DOWN THE RABBIT-HOLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. You can communicate with other players in the game's guestbook and compete with others by collecting points. Points are based on the actual letter frequency in Carroll's original text \u2013 rare letters reward you with higher scores, while common ones offer steady progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;THE END&quot; was the last word in </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alice's Adventures in Wonderland</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>that Lewis Carroll wrote.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And you were the last dot.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>That dot after &quot;THE END&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The last dot that every story has.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Then something strange happened.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Now you need to find your way back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And make the story complete again.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY WITHIN THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a father of two little daughters, I spend countless evenings reading children's books aloud. One night, while reading Lewis Carroll's Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, something magical happened. In my mind's eye, I saw a single dot falling through the letters on the page \u2013 a tiny punctuation mark tumbling through the words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That moment of inspiration became the seed for The Story of the Lost Dot. I knew right away that I needed to make a game of this vision I had. Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, written in 1865, belongs to the public domain, which allowed me to build my game around this classic tale.</p>","developers":["Harha Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/1d7723d2af44b18c295822e5b0c2630cb609ef19/header.jpg?t=1759474431","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2764580/1136252942/230e5b38fa723ae5f6529dd0189c7d1753dea43c/1758893189/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758893625","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2764580/1136252942/230e5b38fa723ae5f6529dd0189c7d1753dea43c/1758893189/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758893625","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2764580/1136252942/230e5b38fa723ae5f6529dd0189c7d1753dea43c/1758893189/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758893625","id":256994521,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256994521/movie480.mp4?t=1758893625","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256994521/movie_max.mp4?t=1758893625"},"name":"Story of the Lost Dot Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256994521/ae4f27046ad937ad1567300e58c10ba2d3d55995/movie_600x