s/steam/apps/2764580/e4ddb64f677ec4ffea1f2f0b8560300a25fd0533/ss_e4ddb64f677ec4ffea1f2f0b8560300a25fd0533.600x338.jpg?t=1759474431"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/3fa53b455eb1ce354f3509cc72fc26ada5801bfb/ss_3fa53b455eb1ce354f3509cc72fc26ada5801bfb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759474431","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/3fa53b455eb1ce354f3509cc72fc26ada5801bfb/ss_3fa53b455eb1ce354f3509cc72fc26ada5801bfb.600x338.jpg?t=1759474431"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/a7e01c3abbce589b3eed085e7e1691fefea59461/ss_a7e01c3abbce589b3eed085e7e1691fefea59461.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759474431","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/a7e01c3abbce589b3eed085e7e1691fefea59461/ss_a7e01c3abbce589b3eed085e7e1691fefea59461.600x338.jpg?t=1759474431"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/ss_b31bc96362b7d90cda5c17a98735270be7306bff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759474431","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764580/ss_b31bc96362b7d90cda5c17a98735270be7306bff.600x338.jpg?t=1759474431"}],"short_description":"Discover the classic tale of Alice's Adventures in Wonderland in a whole new way. A gaming experience where you get to feel what it's like to dive inside a novel as a small dot. Roll left and right, rewind time, and venture deeper through the story as you try to find your way back home.","steam_appid":2764580,"support_info":{"email":"storyofthelostdot@harhaservers.net","url":"https://harhaservers.net/storyofthelostdot"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.harhastudios.net/wordpress/?page_id=542"}